SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 PST: MPI Short Film Lab 2027: narrative short film l
 ab with fellowship grants and a USD 10\,000 script grant (theme: For the G
 reater Good?)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 29 Nov 2026 at 23:59 PST.\n\nThe Moving Picture Institut
 e is a production company and talent incubator that makes films about huma
 n freedom. Its Short Film Lab takes writer-directors from a concept to a f
 inished short script\, and can lead to production as an MPI Original film.
  THEME 2027: For the Greater Good?\n\nOrganisation: Moving Picture Institu
 te (MPI)\nLocation: Mostly virtual\, with an in-person summit in Los Angel
 es\, USA\, for the directing stage. Applicants may be based anywhere in th
 e world.\nAward: Filmmakers accepted into the lab receive fellowship grant
 s (amount not published). One official selection receives a USD 10\,000 gr
 ant\, which includes MPI acquiring the script for further development. Tra
 vel support for the Los Angeles summit is not mentioned. No application fe
 e mentioned.\nDuration: Screenwriting workshop February to April 2027 (abo
 ut ten weeks\, virtual)\; directing workshop June to September 2027\; offi
 cial selection late autumn 2027\n\nMore: https://thempi.org/short-film-lab
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://thempi.org/short-film-lab/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Mostly virtual\, with an in-person summit in Los Angeles\, USA\, f
 or the directing stage. Applicants may be based anywhere in the world.
END:VEVENT
